{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/nix' data-target='computer\/os\/nix' data-title='*Nix'>\r\n\t\t\t*Nix\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/management' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/management' data-title='Management'>\r\n\t\t\tManagement\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Check mode bits, take ownership, and set executable or read permissions.","label":"File","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/nix\/management\/disk","label":"Disk","url":"\/computer\/os\/nix\/management\/disk"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/nix\/management\/firewall","label":"Firewall","url":"\/computer\/os\/nix\/management\/firewall"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tFile ownership and mode bits.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Check rights<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>stat -c %a &lt;Path&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Take ownership<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tTake ownership of a directory and all its files:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>chown -R &lt;User&gt;[:Group] &lt;Path&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCaution: <code class='inline'>chown -R<\/code> changes ownership of the whole tree.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Executable<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>chmod +x<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tA hashbang (<code class='inline'>#!<\/code>) marks the interpreter for an executable script.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Read<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>+r<\/code> adds read permission.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/nix\/management\/file\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/nix\/management\/file\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/management\/disk' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/management\/disk' data-title='Disk' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Disk<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/management\/firewall' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/management\/firewall' data-title='Firewall' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Firewall<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/management' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/management' data-title='Management'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg ' alt='Navigation - 